  <h2>Start Here</h2>
  <p>
    This site gathers practical LS-swap information for the Hyundai Genesis Coupe (BK1 and BK2).
    Content is drawn from long-running community notes and public discussion on Reddit and Facebook.
    Not every tip applies to every year or engine — verify against your car and service manuals.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Before you begin:</strong> join the Facebook groups <em>Swapped GCs</em> and <em>Genesis Coupe LS Swaps</em>.
    Prefer Corvette accessory spacing on BK1 for radiator clearance; BK2 has about 1.5&quot; more room.
    Plan a serious radiator/fan setup and an oil cooler early.
  </p>

